{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34331","headline":"丹阳道中寄友生 · 陆龟蒙","name":"丹阳道中寄友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟树绿微微，春流浸竹扉。\n短蓑携稚去，孤艇载鱼归。\n海俗芦编室，村娃练束衣。\n旧栽奴橘老，新刈女桑肥。\n锦鲤冲风掷，丝禽掠浪飞。\n短亭幽径入，陈庙数峰围。\n地废金牛暗，陵荒石兽稀。\n思君同一望，帆上怨余晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}